    · rename_i h_eq; exact absurd h_eq (by decide)
    · split at hok
      · rename_i h_eq; exact absurd h_eq (by decide)
      · split at hok
        · rename_i h_eq; exact absurd h_eq (by decide)
        · split at hok
          · exact scanBlockScalar_prod_at sc sp hcorr (Or.inl hpeek) (peel_blockScalarGuard hok)
